  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: mod_vhost_alias: stack-based buffer overflow (off-by-one in size check)\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-109163.patch: fix off-by-one in vhost_alias_checkspace() size check\n     - CVE-2026-109163\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: mod_md: NULL pointer dereference on requests without a Host\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-106023.patch: return early when the request has no hostname\n     - CVE-2026-106023\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: mod_http2: race in assign_headers() can lead to RCE\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-119618.patch: set Content-Length on r->headers_in instead of the shared request table\n     - CVE-2026-119618",
